<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq-section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="s-head">
      <div class="s-eyebrow">Questions</div>
      <h2>Common questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-wrap">
      <details open>
        <summary>Is {brand} a lender?
          <span class="faq-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" width="12" height="12"><path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq-body">No. {brand} is a free loan-matching service, not a lender. We connect you with licensed lenders in our network. We have no involvement in the credit decision, loan agreement, or any fees charged by lenders.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Will checking my offers affect my credit score?
          <span class="faq-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" width="12" height="12"><path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq-body">Using {brand} to check offers does not constitute a hard credit inquiry. It will not affect your credit score. If you proceed with a lender and formally accept an offer, that lender may perform a hard credit pull.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What loan amounts are available?
          <span class="faq-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" width="12" height="12"><path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq-body">Lenders in our network offer installment loans from {amountMin} to {amountMax}. The amount you qualify for depends on your state of residence, income, creditworthiness, and individual lender criteria.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How quickly can I receive funds?
          <span class="faq-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" width="12" height="12"><path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq-body">Timing depends entirely on the lender. If approved, many lenders can fund your account as soon as the next business day. {brand} does not control funding timelines, and approval is never guaranteed.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Which states are eligible?
          <span class="faq-ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" width="12" height="12"><path d="M6 1v10M1 6h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span>
        </summary>
        <p class="faq-body">{brand} serves most U.S. states. Availability, maximum loan amounts, and eligible APR ranges vary by state. Residents of some states may not receive offers due to local lending laws or lender restrictions.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

